    "title": "Urgent Opening Hotel Manager at Yum! Brands India Advisory Limited",
    "description": "Grow your career with Yum! Brands India Advisory Limited! We are hiring a Hotel Manager for our Lucknow team. Be part of a workplace that celebrates innovation, diversity, and performance.\n\nAbout Yum! Brands India Advisory Limited:\nYum! Brands India Advisory Limited is a leading organization in the On-site sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Coordinate housekeeping and maintenance for room readiness\n• Manage front office operations including check-in/check-out\n• Deliver exceptional guest experiences in line with brand standards\n• Monitor F&B service quality and maintain hygiene standards\n• Ensure compliance with FSSAI, health, and safety regulations\n• Manage reservations and optimize room revenue through yield management\n• Coordinate with travel agents and OTAs for occupancy optimization\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• MBA from a recognized university\n• 0-1 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Customer Relations\n• Proficiency in Hotel Management\n• Proficiency in Opera PMS\n• Proficiency in HACCP\n• Proficiency in Front Office\n• Proficiency in Travel Management\n• Proficiency in Tour Planning\n• Proficiency in Housekeeping Standards\n\nWork Mode: On-site - Work from our office\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Company-sponsored certifications\n• Work-from-home flexibility\n• Annual paid leaves and casual leaves\n• Annual performance appraisal\n• Transportation and conveyance allowance\n• Referral bonus program\n• Salary Range: 2.5 LPA - 6 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Lucknow, Uttar Pradesh, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Yum! Brands India Advisory Limited!",
